<%- include('partials/header', { pageTitle: 'Privacy Policy — The Florida Buzz', category: null, tickerItems: [], canonicalPath: '/privacy' }) %>

<main class="wrap">
  <article class="article-page">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="byline">Last updated: November 27, 2026</p>

    <div class="article-body">
      <p>This website is owned and operated by Cartzilla LLC ("we," "us," "Florida Buzz"). This page explains what information we collect, how we use it, and the choices you have.</p>

      <h2>Information we collect</h2>
      <p><strong>Newsletter signups:</strong> if you subscribe to our email newsletter, we store the email address you provide to send the newsletter and manage your subscription. We do not sell our newsletter list. Service providers may process subscription information on our behalf to store the list and deliver email.</p>
      <p><strong>Analytics:</strong> we use Google Analytics to understand how visitors use the site, including pages viewed, general location, and device type. We use aggregated reports; Google may process cookie and device identifiers under its own privacy practices. You can opt out of Google Analytics collection using the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Analytics Opt-out Browser Add-on</a>.</p>
      <p><strong>Server logs:</strong> like most websites, our hosting provider automatically logs standard technical information (IP address, browser type, pages requested) for security and performance purposes.</p>

      <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
      <p>Some articles and guides contain affiliate links, including Amazon Associates, Undercover Tourist, and Hotels.com links. If you click one and make a qualifying purchase, we may earn a commission at no additional cost to you. As an Amazon Associate, we earn from qualifying purchases. Affiliate partners and their networks may use cookies or similar technologies to attribute referrals; their privacy policies apply when you use their services.</p>

      <h2>Google advertising and your choices</h2>
      <p>This site integrates Google AdSense. When Google ads are served, third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this website or other websites. Google's advertising cookies enable Google and its partners to serve ads based on visits to this site and other sites on the Internet.</p>
      <p>You can manage or opt out of personalized Google advertising through <a href="https://myadcenter.google.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google My Ad Center</a>. You can also visit <a href="https://optout.aboutads.info/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">YourAdChoices</a> to opt out of personalized advertising from participating third-party vendors. Opting out of personalization does not necessarily remove all advertising.</p>
      <p>Read <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" target="_blank" rel="noopener">how Google uses information from sites and apps that use its services</a> and <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google's advertising technology information</a> for details about its data use and available controls.</p>

      <h2>Third-party services we use</h2>
      <p>We use services including Google Analytics and Google AdSense, affiliate partners and networks, and hosting, email, and database providers. Some providers process information on our behalf; others process information under their own privacy policies when you interact with their services.</p>

      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>Cookies and similar technologies may be used for analytics, advertising, affiliate attribution, and site functionality. You can control or disable cookies through your browser settings; doing so may affect some site functionality. Advertising personalization controls are linked above. Google advertising consent choices, where presented, are separate from a newsletter subscription.</p>

      <h2>Children's privacy</h2>
      <p>This site is not directed at children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect personal information from children.</p>

      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>You can unsubscribe from our newsletter at any time using the link in any newsletter email. You can also opt out of Google Analytics tracking using the browser add-on linked above.</p>

      <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this policy from time to time. The "last updated" date at the top of this page reflects the most recent revision.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about this policy can be sent to <a href="mailto:floridabuzzonline@gmail.com">floridabuzzonline@gmail.com</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</main>

